{"parse":{"text":"<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru inf-form-of\">ува́жить</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru past&#124;act&#124;part-form-of\">ува́живший</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru past&#124;pass&#124;part-form-of\">ува́женный</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru past&#124;adv&#124;part-form-of\">ува́жив</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 1&#124;s&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ува́жу</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;s&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ува́жишь</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 3&#124;s&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ува́жит</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 1&#124;p&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ува́жим</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;p&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ува́жите</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 3&#124;p&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">ува́жат</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;s&#124;imp-form-of\">ува́жь</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;p&#124;imp-form-of\">ува́жьте</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru m&#124;s&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">ува́жил</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru p&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">ува́жили</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru f&#124;s&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">ува́жила</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru n&#124;s&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">ува́жило</i>\n<abbr title=\"perfective aspect\">\nindeclinable"}}